<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3352053); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3352053&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581602682" alt="Cerastes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3352053)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3352053); return false;">Cerastes</a></span></p>
