<p>Cheers! I'm all for expanding the set definitions within the Foundation, so long as they're well defined and easily understood at a glance. Over-saturating articles with in-universe terminology tends to discourage new readers though, aka &quot;The heck is a hume&quot; syndrome&quot;, so I'm trying to be conservative with them.</p>
<p>Also, some of my favorite articles on the site are almost entirely logs! There's room for all varieties of article here, so long as the format serves the narrative. Thanks for the read!</p>

